  "episodes": [
    {
      "id": "village.opening",
      "title": "第一幕 1.1–1.2：被打断的开场与重置教学",
      "entry": "s001",
      "once": true,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "s001",
          "kind": 8,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "很久以前，荒原边上有座安静的小镇。",
          "next": "s002",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s002",
          "kind": 10,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "",
          "next": "s003",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 1.2,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s003",
          "kind": 4,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "",
          "next": "s004",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "village_ground",
          "seconds": 1,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s004",
          "kind": 1,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "这一天，身披重甲、头戴铁盔的骑士堂吉诃德听说，杜尔西内娅公主被巨人掳走了。",
          "next": "s005",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s005",
          "kind": 2,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "等等。\n汝在说谁？",
          "next": "s006",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 5,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s006",
          "kind": 3,
          "speaker": "桑丘",
          "text": "",
          "next": "",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "骑士堂吉诃德握紧了手中的长枪，决定立刻启程。",
              "next": "s007"
            },
            {
              "text": "骑士堂吉诃德望向远方的地平线，心中毫无畏惧。",
              "next": "s007"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s007",
          "kind": 6,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "",
          "next": "s008",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "noop",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s008",
          "kind": 2,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "什么铁盔？还有吾手上什么时候多了根这个？",
          "next": "s009",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 6,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s009",
          "kind": 3,
          "speaker": "桑丘",
          "text": "",
          "next": "",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "堂吉诃德呼唤来了他忠诚的仆人桑丘，准备一同启程。",
              "next": "s010"
            },
            {
              "text": "于是，堂吉诃德整理好盔甲，准备与随从桑丘一同离开村庄。",
              "next": "s010"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s010",
          "kind": 6,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "",
          "next": "s011",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "noop",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s011",
          "kind": 2,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "喂，喂——听得到吗？\n等等，这枪怎么松不开？",
          "next": "s012",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 6,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s012",
          "kind": 3,
          "speaker": "桑丘",
          "text": "",
          "next": "",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "“走吧，桑丘！”堂吉诃德大喊一声，朝村口发起了冲锋。",
              "next": "s013"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s013",
          "kind": 6,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "",
          "next": "s014",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "noop",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s014",
          "kind": 6,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "",
          "next": "s015",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "opening.run",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s015",
          "kind": 5,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "吾没说那句话……等等，腿怎么自己动起来了——\n前面有个坑啊喂！汝看不见的吗！！",
          "next": "s016",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "village.fell",
          "seconds": 60,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s016",
          "kind": 0,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "好痛……而且这坑也太深了吧，吾辈爬不上去啊！\n喂，从刚才起一直在天上念叨的家伙，听得到我说话吗？",
          "next": "s017",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s017",
          "kind": 3,
          "speaker": "桑丘",
          "text": "",
          "next": "",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "听得到，虽然准确来说是看得到。上面好像多了个按 R 重置的按钮。",
              "next": "s018"
            },
            {
              "text": "哇，有立绘了。不过为什么你穿着T恤衫？",
              "next": "s019"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s018",
          "kind": 0,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "总算有回应了！重置？你是说能把吾辈弄回上面去？\n那还等什么，快按下 R 键试试！吾可不想一辈子蹲在这个坑底！",
          "next": "s020",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s019",
          "kind": 0,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "现在是说这个的时候吗？？看，上面出现了一行字！先按R键把吾辈放出去！",
          "next": "s020",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s020",
          "kind": 6,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "",
          "next": "s021",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "opening.reset_only",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s021",
          "kind": 5,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "快按 R 键（或双击）把吾重置回上面吧！",
          "next": "s022",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "village.reset",
          "seconds": 3600,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s022",
          "kind": 6,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "",
          "next": "",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "opening.reset_done",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "village.reunion",
      "title": "第一幕 1.3：正式认识桑丘",
      "entry": "s001",
      "once": true,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "s001",
          "kind": 0,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "……真的回来了。\n不过，汝刚才一直在念什么呢？听起来像是什么故事的开头，堂吉诃德又是谁……诶，等等，我是堂吉诃德吗？",
          "next": "s002",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s002",
          "kind": 3,
          "speaker": "桑丘",
          "text": "",
          "next": "",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "看起来是这样。",
              "next": "s003"
            },
            {
              "text": "所以你为什么穿着T恤衫？头上的头盔有点怪。",
              "next": "s004"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s003",
          "kind": 0,
          "speaker": "堂吉诃德",
          "text": "什么情况……不过，既然吾是堂吉诃德，汝方才念到的“桑丘”人呢？这村子里连个人影都没有。",
          "next": "s005",
          "alternate": "",
          "argument": "",
          "seconds": 3,
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s004",
          "kind": 0,
